# Organizing Antigravity Projects

This plan outlines the steps to move the `telegram-study-bot` project and related files into the `Mis Proyectos Antigravity` folder for better organization.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will need to stop the running bot processes (`lanzador_bot.bat`) before moving the folder. You will need to restart the bot from its new location if you want to keep it running.

## Proposed Changes

### Project Organization

#### [MOVE] [telegram-study-bot](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/telegram-study-bot) to `C:\Users\Antonio\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\Mis Proyectos Antigravity\telegram-study-bot`

Summary of what will change:
- Stop all running instances of `python.exe` and `cmd.exe` related to the bot.
- Move the entire directory to the new location.

#### [MOVE] [Lanzador_Bot_Estudio.bat](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/Desktop/Lanzador_Bot_Estudio.bat) to `C:\Users\Antonio\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\Mis Proyectos Antigravity\telegram-study-bot\Lanzador_Bot_Estudio.bat`
#### [MOVE] [debug_sefaria.py](file:///C:/Users/Antonio/Desktop/debug_sefaria.py) to `C:\Users\Antonio\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\Mis Proyectos Antigravity\telegram-study-bot\debug_sefaria.py`

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify that the `telegram-study-bot` directory exists in `C:\Users\Antonio\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\Mis Proyectos Antigravity\`.
- Verify that the files from the Desktop have been moved to the new location.
- Inform the user that the bot needs to be restarted from the new location.
